    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage a thriving metropolis in this ultimate idle city-building game. Start with a small plot of land, construct buildings, and expand your city into a bustling hub of activity. Upgrade your infrastructure, unlock new structures, and boost your earnings to achieve ultimate success.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422900/extras/f3d1bba48389186e894bd59b3409af7c.poster.avif?t=1739000594\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422900/extras/f3d1bba48389186e894bd59b3409af7c.webm?t=1739000594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422900/extras/f3d1bba48389186e894bd59b3409af7c.mp4?t=1739000594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct Stunning Cities</strong>: Create and upgrade buildings with vibrant, detailed town graphics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422900/extras/1b0bad86dd3d377e05c5264d3d64bb37.avif?t=1739000594\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Industry Leaders</strong>: Interact with music moguls, IT geniuses, and engineers to accelerate your progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422900/extras/19db84005cec76b7c9b0e0b0c8251ae9.avif?t=1739000594\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige and Expand</strong>: Flip your town by securing investors, acquire even bigger towns, and keep building your empire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422900/extras/114f436be60d49f8e8f8f92b7d56d347.avif?t=1739000594\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn While Offline</strong>: Generate income even when you're away and return to a wealthier city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized Gameplay</strong>: Enjoy smooth, responsive play on any device.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to design, grow, and dominate as the ultimate <strong>Town Billionaire</strong>!</p>",
